ependent). ITD optimizes each stage of this funnel via qualifying + WhatsApp nurture + inside-sales."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How does ITD retarget trichology patients who didn't book?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Retargeting flow: (1) 7-day WhatsApp nurture with case studies + testimonials + FAQ, (2) 14-day Meta + Google Display retargeting with different offer or educational content, (3) 30-day email newsletter with clinic updates + patient education, (4) 60-day 'we miss you' re-engagement offer, (5) 90-day drop from retargeting audience (freeze budget). 15-30% of initially-abandoned inquiries convert via this flow within 90 days."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can ITD generate leads for trichology from Tier-2 cities + smaller markets?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes \u2014 Nashik + Nagpur + Indore + Coimbatore + Kochi + Jaipur + Chandigarh + Lucknow are strong Tier-2 markets. Tier-2 city lead-gen strategy: (1) lower CPI (Rs 60-300/inquiry vs Rs 200-800 in Tier-1 metros), (2) higher WhatsApp + phone conversion (Tier-2 patients prefer voice), (3) local language creatives (Hindi, Marathi, Tamil, Telugu, Kannada, Malayalam, Arabic in GCC), (4) local landmark + city name in ad creative, (5) transport + travel-fit content (many Tier-2 patients travel to metro for high-AOV). Tier-2 markets often deliver 2-3x LTV/CAC ratio."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do we prevent bot + spam leads for a trichology clinic?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "ITD's anti-spam + bot lead-gen protocol: (1) reCAPTCHA v3 on all forms, (2) honeypot fields + JS nonce, (3) IP + device + timing rate-limiting, (4) form field consistency checks, (5) WhatsApp verify via OTP for high-AOV, (6) inside-sales phone verification, (7) suspicious pattern flagging via CRM. Typical spam-lead reduction 85-95%. Real cost of spam: wasted inside-sales time + polluted CRM data."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How does ITD attribute trichology patient leads to specific channels?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Multi-touch attribution stack: (1) UTM parameters on all links + ad creatives, (2) Meta CAPI + Google Enhanced Conversions for server-side attribution, (3) call tracking with dynamic phone-number swap (CallRail / Freshcaller / native), (4) offline conversion upload for closed procedures, (5) LTV cohort attribution back to first-touch channel, (6) monthly QBR with full-funnel attribution report. Attribution accuracy 85-95% at optimized setup."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What's the fastest way to double patient leads for a trichology clinic?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Fast-track playbook (first 60 days): (1) fix Google Business Profile + generate 20+ new reviews (Week 1-3) \u2014 +20-50% Map Pack traffic, (2) launch Meta CTWA ads + WhatsApp Cloud API (Week 2-4) \u2014 +40-100% inquiry volume, (3) publish 10-15 educational Reels + first on-site shoot (Week 3-6) \u2014 +30-80% organic reach, (4) set up landing pages + booking + inside-sales SLA (Week 4-6) \u2014 +30-50% conversion. Combined effect: 2-4x leads in 60 days. Adjacent to our flagship dermatology engagement, we support trichology + hair transplant clinics across India + GCC."}}]}</script>
